{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2020-04", "window": 3, "start_date": 1586995200, "end_date": 1587599999, "month_true_total": 33, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:05:14 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "67808084", "author": {"steamid": "76561198846979528", "personaname": "AndreaWasBored", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198846979528/", "num_games_owned": 155, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 91, "last_played": 1587642853, "avatar": "0640c18f18dee1cfb484438ffc4f9050b912dc43"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its A Good Game ngl, I was just searching the TF2 Hat, then when i played 2 games, i instantly liked it.\n", "timestamp_created": 1587550059, "timestamp_updated": 1587550059, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "67650289", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055685550", "personaname": "Horrorcrawler, BSN", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Horrorcrawler/", "num_games_owned": 1116, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 299, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 85, "last_played": 1587534982, "avatar": "319a30bffe5c405916e9c2f51771a78df6740834"}, "language": "english", "review": "For a free game this is absolutely amazing, very heavily influenced by Alien (the alien on the front looks dead up like a face-hugger I mean come on.) That I believe is one of the reasons we love it so much, I am a huge horror movie fan and it was a rush of pure Nostalgia as well and genuinely making me feel like I was a Marine in Alien. It has an overhanging uneasy feeling because atmosphere is great, ammo is scarce, and aliens are plenty. It is not strictly horror but I would recommend this game because its FREE, Co-op, and only about 2GB to download. Unfortunately this game gets progressively difficult and later on pretty much REQUIRES you to have and well thought out team of 4 marines to survive.", "timestamp_created": 1587332090, "timestamp_updated": 1587332090, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.569011569023132324", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "67591085", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019537506", "personaname": "Indaletius RIRF", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198019537506/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 139, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 140, "last_played": 1485501413, "avatar": "e72faf04ee0dbfeaabb8608d83866d66aa2ef54e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I tried to play it with some friends years ago; I'd say it was quite complicated for just a so simple game; I want to give it a try in a future time.", "timestamp_created": 1587251440, "timestamp_updated": 1587251440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "67570495", "author": {"steamid": "76561199023394113", "personaname": "kumy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gpointkamel/", "num_games_owned": 9, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 3879, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2705, "last_played": 1587393049, "av